 clause) -- the SAME honest quantitative/qualitative discipline this
 fleet established, just with a different jurisdiction landing on
 `:qualitative` than `cloud-itonami-isic-4329`'s DEU case, because that is
 what the real regulatory landscape for THIS hazard actually looks like.

